{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adventure-simulator-group/fabelgeist/pulls/991","id":5027491757,"node_id":"PR_kwDOPo01Gc8AAAABK6lvrQ","html_url":"https://github.com/adventure-simulator-group/fabelgeist/pull/991","diff_url":"https://github.com/adventure-simulator-group/fabelgeist/pull/991.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/adventure-simulator-group/fabelgeist/pull/991.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adventure-simulator-group/fabelgeist/issues/991","number":991,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Retain motion identity in catalog errors","user":{"login":"segovb","id":70238035,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMjM4MDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70238035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/segovb","html_url":"https://github.com/segovb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/segovb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/segovb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/segovb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/segovb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/segovb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/segovb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/segovb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/segovb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/segovb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Animation catalog builders receive a checked `MotionId`, then convert it to\n`String` when a pack lacks that motion. Store the existing `MotionId` in\n`CatalogError::UnknownMotion` at both pose and reference error producers so\nthe failure retains its admitted identity.\n\nInvalid-motion-stem and invalid-directory rejections continue to carry the\noffending raw input. Related: #780 and #726.\n\n## Validation\n\nIndependent Code, Rule and Comment source reviews found no actionable\nfindings on `ff43d1818`. The\n[hosted run](https://github.com/adventure-simulator-group/fabelgeist/actions/runs/40436696284)\npassed formatting, Clippy with warnings denied, existing animation, rig,\ngeometry and terrain checks, GPU validation, and Windows portability.\nRequired execution artifacts were checked against this revision.\nThe terrain logs include 14 ignored cases.\nNo tests, cases, helpers, assertions or doctests were added.\n\n## Implementation context\n\nThe error reuses the canonical animation `MotionId`; both producers clone\nthe supplied identifier. Source inspection covers both producers and the\ncatalog-construction diagnostics that receive their errors.\n","created_at":"2026-10-27T02:08:27Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T03:17:38Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"b206f36526221b7de3f329476755156ccc080328","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adventure-simulator-group/fabelgeist/pulls/991/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adventure-simulator-group/fabelgeist/pulls/991/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adventure-simulator-group/fabelgeist/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adventure-simulator-group/fabelgeist/issues/991/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adventure-simulator-group/fabelgeist/statuses/ff43d18185572d19d9d2492873b9ff08f7ae14dd","head":{"label":"adventure-simulator-group:codex/780-retain-motion-error-identity","ref":"codex/780-retain-motion-error-identity","sha":"ff43d18185572d19d9d2492873b9ff08f7ae14dd","user":{"login":"adventure-simulator-group","id":230064938,"node_id":"O_kgDODbaDKg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230064938?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adventure-simulator-group","html_url":"https://github.com/adventure-simulator-group","followers_url":"https://api.githu